  summary: "Khan Academy beyond the United States: translated sites in more than 50 languages, country sites for India, Brazil and Mexico, offices in India and Brazil with a controlled related organization in each, independent partner entities elsewhere, and an offline route through Kolibri, an open-source platform from Learning Equality."
  owner: O:role/International-Lead
  confidence: 0.8
