- id: P:function/platform-development
  type: function
  name: Platform development
  summary: "The engineering behind the web and mobile software that gives learners a personalised, always-available tutor-like experience. The Form 990's largest program service: $51.2M of expense in the year to June 2025 and $22.1M of program revenue, with an average of 8.5 million active learners a month in more than 190 countries."
  owner: O:role/Chief-Technology-Officer
  confidence: 0.9
  sources: [f990-2025, github-khan]
  visibility: public
  parts: [P:product/learning-platform, P:product/mobile-apps, P:product/khanmigo-ai]
  flow:
    inputs:
      - {resource: funding, from: P:function/fundraising, unit: USD/year}
  substrate:
    platforms: [S:system/learning-platform, S:system/backend-services, S:system/khanmigo-ai]
    vendors: [S:vendor/openai, S:vendor/google, S:vendor/microsoft]
    depends-on: [S:vendor/openai, S:vendor/google, S:vendor/microsoft]
    roles-required: [{role: O:role/Chief-Technology-Officer, load: large}]
    budget: "$51.2M of program expense in the year to June 2025 (Form 990 Part III, line 4a)"
  mattering:
    to-the-whole: "The platform is the product; every offering reaches a person through it."
    weight: critical
    inside:
      - who: [O:role/Chief-Technology-Officer]
        because: "A small engineering organisation runs a service used by millions, and publishes much of its code for others to use."
        confidence: 0.5

- id: P:function/content-creation
  type: function
  name: Content creation and curation
  summary: "The library of free educational resources and the partnerships that add to it: about 800 active courses, 20,000 videos, 12,500 sets of practice problems and 10,250 articles at 30 June 2025, with partner courses from museums, science agencies and others. $12.1M of program expense in the year to June 2025."
  owner: O:role/Chief-Learning-Officer
  confidence: 0.9
  sources: [f990-2025, ka-partner-content]
  visibility: public
  flow:
